# .gitignore v1.0.0 — added Round 17 (Linotype).
#
# There was no .gitignore before this one. That was survivable only because Jake
# deploys from a browser and never runs npm in the working tree — but every
# Claude session that runs `npm test` creates node_modules/, and a session that
# then committed through github.dev would have pushed ~20,000 files into a repo
# GitHub Pages serves. One line prevents that.

node_modules/
package-lock.json

# macOS writes these into every folder Finder touches, including the one you are
# about to drag into github.dev.
.DS_Store
._*

# Scratch output from the corpus harnesses and the EPUB builders in tools/.
*.log
/tmp/
